Guidelime.registerGuide([[
[D Quests for The Stockade \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 26-29 The Stockade]
[NX 28-32 City of Dalaran]

-- Alliance: Stormwind pickups, then Lakeshire, Darkshire and Dun Modr.
[A Alliance] In Old Town, Nikova Raskol gives [QA388 The Color of Blood] [G76.4,63.7 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] If you handed in *The Unsent Letter*, Baros Alexston in the Cathedral Square gives [QA389 Bazil Thredd] [G57.7,47.9 Stormwind City] \\ The Unsent Letter comes from the Deadmines guide; without it, skip 389 and 391. Krazore (level 44) near the Cathedral may attack.
[A Alliance] Warden Thelwater stands by the Stockade door in the Canal District: accept [QA387 Quell The Uprising], and, only if you have Bazil Thredd from The Unsent Letter (Deadmines guide), turn in [QT389 Bazil Thredd] and accept [QA391 The Stockade Riots] [G51.5,69.4 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Fly to Lakeshire [F Lakeshire] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Cross the bridge north over the lake into Lakeshire [G27.5,53.0 Redridge Mountains] \\ The Stormwind Crier (level 50) by the bridge and an Incubus near Lakeshire may attack.
[A Alliance] Guard Berton gives [QA386 What Comes Around...] [G21.2,46.6 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Walk back over the bridge and fly to Darkshire [F Darkshire] [G27.5,53.0 Redridge Mountains][G25.3,59.0 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Councilman Millstipe in Darkshire gives [QA377 Crime and Punishment] [G71.9,47.8 Duskwood]
[A Alliance] Fly to Menethil Harbor, by way of Stormwind and Ironforge [F Menethil Harbor] [G77.6,44.4 Duskwood] \\ A Mistmantle Prowler (elite, level 60) may be near the Darkshire flight master.
[A Alliance] Leave town over the bridge and follow the road east [G12.3,52.2 Wetlands][G15.2,45.7 Wetlands][G22.0,43.4 Wetlands][G39.2,36.9 Wetlands] \\ Wetlands mobs reach level 25-30; stay on the road. Elite Highland Lurkers, Elder Crocolisks and Highland Horrors (level 27-29) and the elites Goaz Warder, Modr and Nightveiled Rotheap (level 31-32) may be near it.
[A Alliance] Cross the bridge and turn north up the road to Dun Modr [G49.7,37.1 Wetlands][G49.7,26.0 Wetlands] \\ Elite Dragonmaw (level 29-30) may be near the bridge, and the elites Golm and Neru (level 32) close to the road.
[A Alliance] Motley Garmason at Dun Modr gives [QA303 The Dark Iron War] [G49.7,18.2 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Kill Dark Iron Dwarves, Tunnelers, Saboteurs and Demolitionists at the arrow [QC303 The Dark Iron War] [G47.5,16.5 Wetlands] \\ They are elite, level 27-31, with elite Riflemen and Balgaras the Foul (elite, level 34) among them: bring a group.
[A Alliance] Back to Motley: turn in [QT303 The Dark Iron War] and accept [QA378 The Fury Runs Deep] [G49.7,18.2 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Run back down the road to Menethil Harbor [G49.7,26.0 Wetlands][G49.7,37.1 Wetlands][G39.2,36.9 Wetlands][G22.0,43.4 Wetlands][G15.2,45.7 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands][G9.5,59.7 Wetlands] \\ The same elites (level 27-32) may be near the road.
[A Alliance] Fly to Stormwind, by way of Ironforge [F Stormwind] [G9.5,59.7 Wetlands]
[A Alliance] Walk to the Stockade door in the Canal District [G52.4,70.0 Stormwind City]

-- Left out: 392-396 continue the Stormwind chain after 391 and are not Stockade quests.
-- Horde: no quests here.
[A Horde] The Stockade has no Horde quests. Skip to the next guide.

Inside the Stockade:
[A Alliance] [QC388 The Color of Blood] Red Wool Bandanas drop from Defias Prisoners, Convicts, Insurgents, Captives and Inmates; collect 10 as you go.
[A Alliance] Kill 10 Defias Prisoners [QC387,1 Quell The Uprising]
[A Alliance] Kill 8 Defias Convicts [QC387,2 Quell The Uprising]
[A Alliance] Kill 8 Defias Insurgents [QC387,3 Quell The Uprising]
[A Alliance] Kill Targorr the Dread for his head [QC386 What Comes Around...]
[A Alliance] Kill Kam Deepfury for his head [QC378 The Fury Runs Deep]
[A Alliance] Kill Dextren Ward for his hand [QC377 Crime and Punishment]
[A Alliance] Kill Bazil Thredd for his head [QC391 The Stockade Riots]

-- Alliance turn-ins.
[A Alliance] Warden Thelwater: turn in [QT387 Quell The Uprising] and [QT391 The Stockade Riots] [G51.5,69.4 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Nikova Raskol in Old Town: turn in [QT388 The Color of Blood] [G76.4,63.7 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Fly to Lakeshire [F Lakeshire] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Cross the bridge into Lakeshire [G27.5,53.0 Redridge Mountains] \\ The Stormwind Crier (level 50) by the bridge and an Incubus near Lakeshire may attack.
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT386 What Comes Around...] to Guard Berton [G21.2,46.6 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Walk back over the bridge and fly to Darkshire [F Darkshire] [G27.5,53.0 Redridge Mountains][G25.3,59.0 Redridge Mountains]
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT377 Crime and Punishment] to Councilman Millstipe [G71.9,47.8 Duskwood]
[A Alliance] Fly to Menethil Harbor, by way of Stormwind and Ironforge [F Menethil Harbor] [G77.6,44.4 Duskwood] \\ The elite Mistmantle Prowler (level 60) may be near the flight master.
[A Alliance] Follow the road east and north to Dun Modr [G12.3,52.2 Wetlands][G15.2,45.7 Wetlands][G22.0,43.4 Wetlands][G39.2,36.9 Wetlands][G49.7,37.1 Wetlands][G49.7,26.0 Wetlands] \\ The same elites as before (level 27-32) may be near the road.
[A Alliance] Turn in [QT378 The Fury Runs Deep] to Motley Garmason [G49.7,18.2 Wetlands]
]], 'DungeonQuests - JanRK')
